    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectDetected? THEN\n\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\t\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\t\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectHeavy? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tDO MoveObject\n\t\t\tELSE\n\t\t\t\tDO ProcessObject\n\t\t\t\t\tIF IsTaskCompleted? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tDO ReturnToOrigin\n\t\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
